**/*.rs.bk

# Remove Cargo.lock from git by default for libraries
# see https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/guide/cargo-toml-vs-cargo-lock.html
# Cargo.lock is committed for binaries; for libraries it's often ignored.
Cargo.lock

